      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>If Sirius rises on day 25 of Ab\u012bb</li>\n<li>and the moon is lodged in Cancer, then it indicates</li>\n<li>what will be in it (the year): gentle winds that will come</li>\n<li>from the north. But this good will not last.</li>\n<li>The Nile will rise high. There will appear among people evil</li>\n<li>bile and an evil, malignant illness. An eclipse will be seen,</li>\n<li>and a group of leaders and peers (?) will die.</li>\n<li>There will be <del>fighting</del> discord among people, especially among</li>\n<li>the notables. Wheat will be scarce and in demand. There will be</li>\n<li>fighting in Egypt and Syria. There will be fear for the king</li>\n<li>on account of illness and other causes of destruction.</li>\n<li>If it rains water for 3 days, there will be no benefit,</li>\n<li>and it will be a sign of the king's demise and the cessation of benefaction.</li>\n<li>Many cattle will perish. People will be displaced from</li>\n<li>the district of Sudan. The moon will be eclipsed in</li>\n<li>the district of the east and toward the south until nothing</li>\n<li>of it is seen. Corruption will be abundant, and there will be fear</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 1
    }
